---
output: preproc
---
@startuml
' A variable assigned without '$' in a diagram without Python is the legacy
' assignment it was before Python (issue #3032): "t" is replaced in the text.
' The warning about the missing '$' is in assignment_without_dollar_warning.
' EXPECT (preproc):
' repeat while (x) is (this is t1\nthis is t2\nthis is t3\n)
!t="this is t1\nthis is t2\nthis is t3\n"

repeat
  :read data;
  :generate diagrams;
repeat while (x) is (t)
stop
@enduml
